IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sfa-core`
IMPORT `sfab-division-2`

-- Tests for sfab-division-2 (Securities and Futures Act 2001, Part 12). Every expected value below is written from the text of the section named above it,
-- by hand, with the inputs that decide it; none is copied from output. Case order: the case that meets the provision, then each input taken away in turn,
-- then the case the text does not decide. A `#S` case is one that takes a branch marked SPLIT-SITE in the module.


-- s 205 this Division applies to the act
#ASSERT `s 205 this Division applies to the act` (JUST TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 205 this Division applies to the act` NOTHING (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 205 this Division applies to the act` NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 205 this Division applies to the act` (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 205(a) this Division applies to the act occurring within Singapore
#ASSERT `s 205(a) this Division applies to the act occurring within Singapore` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 205(a) this Division applies to the act occurring within Singapore` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING  -- S
#ASSERT `s 205(a) this Division applies to the act occurring within Singapore` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING  -- S

-- s 205(b) this Division applies to the act occurring outside Singapore
#ASSERT `s 205(b) this Division applies to the act occurring outside Singapore` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 205(b) this Division applies to the act occurring outside Singapore` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING  -- S
#ASSERT `s 205(b) this Division applies to the act occurring outside Singapore` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING  -- S

-- s 206 "administer" the activity is to administer the financial benchmark
#ASSERT `s 206 "administer" the activity is to administer the financial benchmark` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 206 "administer" the activity is to administer the financial benchmark` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 206 "administer" the activity is to administer the financial benchmark` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 206 "international body" the body is an international body
#ASSERT `s 206 "international body" the body is an international body` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 206 "international body" the body is an international body` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 206 "international body" the body is an international body` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 206 "international body" the body is an international body` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- s 206 "public authority" the body is a public authority
#ASSERT `s 206 "public authority" the body is a public authority` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 206 "public authority" the body is a public authority` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 206 "public authority" the body is a public authority` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 206 "public authority" the body is a public authority` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- s 207(1) the person's conduct contravenes the bar on conduct done to create a false appearance as to a financial benchmark
#ASSERT `s 207(1) the person's conduct contravenes the bar on conduct done to create a false appearance as to a financial benchmark` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 207(1) the person's conduct contravenes the bar on conduct done to create a false appearance as to a financial benchmark` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE  -- S
#ASSERT `s 207(1) the person's conduct contravenes the bar on conduct done to create a false appearance as to a financial benchmark` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING  -- S

-- s 207(2) the person's conduct contravenes the bar on conduct that creates a false appearance as to a financial benchmark knowingly or recklessly
#ASSERT `s 207(2) the person's conduct contravenes the bar on conduct that creates a false appearance as to a financial benchmark knowingly or recklessly` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 207(2) the person's conduct contravenes the bar on conduct that creates a false appearance as to a financial benchmark knowingly or recklessly` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 207(2) the person's conduct contravenes the bar on conduct that creates a false appearance as to a financial benchmark knowingly or recklessly` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE  -- S
#ASSERT `s 207(2) the person's conduct contravenes the bar on conduct that creates a false appearance as to a financial benchmark knowingly or recklessly` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING  -- S
#ASSERT `s 207(2) the person's conduct contravenes the bar on conduct that creates a false appearance as to a financial benchmark knowingly or recklessly` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING  -- S

-- s 208 section 207 does not apply to the thing done
#ASSERT `s 208 section 207 does not apply to the thing done` (JUST TRUE) NOTHING TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 208 section 207 does not apply to the thing done` NOTHING (JUST TRUE) FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 208 section 207 does not apply to the thing done` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 208 section 207 does not apply to the thing done` (JUST TRUE) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 208 section 207 does not apply to the thing done` NOTHING NOTHING TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 208 section 207 does not apply to the thing done` (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 209 the person's statement contravenes the bar on false or misleading statements to a benchmark administrator
#ASSERT `s 209 the person's statement contravenes the bar on false or misleading statements to a benchmark administrator` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 209 the person's statement contravenes the bar on false or misleading statements to a benchmark administrator` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 209 the person's statement contravenes the bar on false or misleading statements to a benchmark administrator` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE  -- S
#ASSERT `s 209 the person's statement contravenes the bar on false or misleading statements to a benchmark administrator` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE  -- S
#ASSERT `s 209 the person's statement contravenes the bar on false or misleading statements to a benchmark administrator` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING  -- S

-- s 210(1) the penalty on conviction for contravening a provision of Division 2
#ASSERT `s 210(1) the penalty on conviction for contravening a provision of Division 2` EQUALS (Penalty OF 250000, 84, TRUE, 0)

-- s 210(1) the person is guilty of an offence
#ASSERT `s 210(1) the person is guilty of an offence` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 210(1) the person is guilty of an offence` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING  -- S
#ASSERT `s 210(1) the person is guilty of an offence` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING  -- S

-- s 210(2) proceedings for an offence in respect of the contravention are barred
#ASSERT `s 210(2) proceedings for an offence in respect of the contravention are barred` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 210(2) proceedings for an offence in respect of the contravention are barred` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 210(2) proceedings for an offence in respect of the contravention are barred` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 207(1) a person must not act for the purpose of creating a false or misleading appearance as to a financial benchmark
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 207(1) a person must not act for the purpose of creating a false or misleading appearance as to a financial benchmark` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY (Individual "a person") DOES `s 207(1) do a thing, cause a thing to be done or engage in a course of conduct for the purpose of creating a false or misleading appearance as to a financial benchmark` AT 1
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 207(1) a person must not act for the purpose of creating a false or misleading appearance as to a financial benchmark` AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 5)

-- s 207(2) a person must not do a thing that creates a false or misleading appearance as to a financial benchmark knowingly or recklessly
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 207(2) a person must not do a thing that creates a false or misleading appearance as to a financial benchmark knowingly or recklessly` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY (Individual "a person") DOES `s 207(2) do a thing that creates, or is likely to create, a false or misleading appearance as to a financial benchmark, knowingly or recklessly` AT 1
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 207(2) a person must not do a thing that creates a false or misleading appearance as to a financial benchmark knowingly or recklessly` AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 5)

-- s 209 a person must not make a false or misleading statement to a person administering a financial benchmark
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 209 a person must not make a false or misleading statement to a person administering a financial benchmark` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY (Individual "a person") DOES `s 209 make a statement, disseminate information or express an opinion that is false or misleading in a material particular to a person administering a financial benchmark` AT 1
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 209 a person must not make a false or misleading statement to a person administering a financial benchmark` AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 5)
